{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An atmospheric visual novel that forces you to face your demons \u2014 both literal and figurative.\u00a0This narrative game is as personal (or spine tingling) as you choose. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The setting: A full moon. A notoriously supernatural forest. On the anniversary of your twin sister's mysterious death.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tonight is your night to reach her.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3877760/extras/b88d3f449bbed1c966de79480ad7e2b2.poster.avif?t=1768603782\" width=616 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3877760/extras/b88d3f449bbed1c966de79480ad7e2b2.webm?t=1768603782\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3877760/extras/b88d3f449bbed1c966de79480ad7e2b2.mp4?t=1768603782\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 About 1 hour of gameplay\u00a0<br>\u2022 Seance complete with animated spirit board\u00a0 <br>\u2022 Choose your path: Cozy horror\u00a0<i>or</i> emotional resonance <br>\u2022 100% Handmade Artwork\u00a0 <br>\u2022 Atmospheric sound design <br>\u2022 Original soundtrack by Jeramy Parker</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3877760/extras/a604cab2225d49fc6de4f72af468dd4a.poster.avif?t=1768603782\" width=616 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3877760/extras/a604cab2225d49fc6de4f72af468dd4a.webm?t=1768603782\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\">